            "handlerDescription": "Get the verified customer's usage in the current bill cycle: data used vs allowance, voice minutes and texts used, days abroad and roaming charges so far this cycle, the roaming limit, TravelPass enrolment, days left in the cycle, and for each of the last 3 cycles the data used and the countries/days the phone was used abroad (from network roaming records).",
            "toolTitle": "",
