          "description": "List the verified customer's premium content subscriptions (item_id such as SUB-1001, service name, ACTIVE or CANCELLED, monthly price, start date, end date) and their TravelPass enrolment (ENROLLED or NOT_ENROLLED; $10 per day, charged only on days used abroad). Use the item_id when proposing CANCEL_SUBSCRIPTION.",
